function pixelIcon(id){const shapes={quests:['11111100','10000110','10110110','10000110','10110110','10000100','11111100'],account:['00111000','00111000','00010000','01111100','11111110','11010110'],daily:['01000100','11111110','10000010','10111010','10101010','11111110'],wheel:['00111000','01111100','11101110','11010110','11101110','01111100','00111000'],ach:['11000110','11111110','01111100','00111000','00010000','00111000'],chat:['11111110','10000010','10111010','10000010','11111110','00110000','00100000'],rank:['10111010','11111110','01111100','00111000','00010000','00111000','01111100'],online:['01100110','01100110','00000000','11111111','10111101','10100101'],gift:['00101000','01111100','11111110','00010000','11111110','10010010','11111110']};const svg=document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg','svg');svg.setAttribute('viewBox','0 0 8 8');svg.setAttribute('width','18');svg.setAttribute('height','18');svg.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');svg.style.cssText='display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;flex-shrink:0;shape-rendering:crispEdges;fill:currentColor;margin-right:5px';(shapes[id]||shapes.ach).forEach((r,y)=>[...r].forEach((v,x)=>{if(v==='1'){const p=document.createElementNS(svg.namespaceURI,'rect');p.setAttribute('x',x);p.setAttribute('y',y);p.setAttribute('width','1');p.setAttribute('height','1');const palettes={account:['#bbcbd6','#6aafe0','#4a2c14'],daily:['#fff6dc','#e95b56','#8a5a30'],quests:['#f6e7c3','#6aafe0','#8a5a30'],wheel:['#e95b56','#78c69d','#f1c453','#6aafe0'],ach:['#f1c453','#efa83f','#8a5a30'],chat:['#6aafe0','#bbcbd6','#19344B'],rank:['#ffd678','#efa83f','#8a5a30'],online:['#78c69d','#6aafe0','#f6e7c3'],gift:['#8a5a30','#f1c453','#c8402a']},pal=palettes[id]||palettes.ach;p.setAttribute('fill',pal[(Math.floor(y/2)+Math.floor(x/3))%pal.length]);svg.append(p)}}));return svg}
for(const [id,label] of MENU){const short={account:'Tài khoản',daily:'Điểm danh',quests:'Nhiệm vụ',wheel:'Vòng quay',ach:'Thành tựu',chat:'Truyền âm',rank:'BXH',online:'Đồng đạo',gift:'Gift'};const b=btn(undefined,()=>open(id));b.append(el('span',short[id],'pn-menu-label'));b.setAttribute('aria-label',label);b.title=label;b.prepend(pixelIcon(id));dock.querySelector('nav').append(b)}
function close(){if(!user)return;modal.hidden=true;modal.classList.remove('pn-account-page');lobby.inert=false;head.inert=false;$('pn-body').replaceChildren();focusBefore?.focus()}
$('pn-close').onclick=close;modal.addEventListener('click',e=>{if(e.target===modal)close()});modal.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Escape'){e.stopPropagation();close()}if(e.key==='Tab'){const a=[...modal.querySelectorAll('button,input')].filter(x=>!x.disabled&&x.offsetParent!==null),f=a[0],l=a[a.length-1];if(e.shiftKey&&document.activeElement===f){e.preventDefault();l.focus()}else if(!e.shiftKey&&document.activeElement===l){e.preventDefault();f.focus()}}});
function clampLobby(){}
function layout(){const nav=$('sanhNav');if(nav){const safe=Math.ceil(nav.getBoundingClientRect().height)+10;taskStack.style.setProperty('--pn-nav-safe',safe+'px');$('sanhV')?.style.setProperty('--pn-foot-safe',(safe+taskStack.offsetHeight+10)+'px')}const show=!lobby.hidden;head.hidden=!show;dock.hidden=!show;if(top){const v=$('sanhV').getBoundingClientRect(),r=top.getBoundingClientRect(),side=$('sanhSide')?.getBoundingClientRect();head.style.top=(r.bottom-v.top+10)+'px';const ng=$('sanhV').classList.contains('ngang');head.style.left=ng?'auto':'12px';head.style.right=ng?'8px':'auto';head.style.width=ng?'164px':'136px'}clampLobby()}
const CORNER_PREF='vktt_corner_menu_collapsed';let cornerCollapsed=false;
function collapse(){dock.classList.toggle('collapsed',cornerCollapsed);const b=$('pn-toggle'),n=dock.querySelector('nav');n.id='pn-corner-nav';n.inert=cornerCollapsed;n.setAttribute('aria-hidden',String(cornerCollapsed));b.setAttribute('aria-controls',n.id);b.setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(!cornerCollapsed));b.setAttribute('aria-label',cornerCollapsed?'Mở menu sự kiện':'Đóng menu sự kiện');b.title=cornerCollapsed?'Mở menu sự kiện':'Đóng menu sự kiện';b.textContent=cornerCollapsed?'Thêm':'Thu gọn';layout();}
$('pn-toggle').onclick=()=>{cornerCollapsed=!cornerCollapsed;try{localStorage.setItem(CORNER_PREF,cornerCollapsed?'1':'0')}catch(e){}collapse()};new MutationObserver(layout).observe(lobby,{attributes:true,attributeFilter:['hidden']});new ResizeObserver(()=>{layout()}).observe(dock);addEventListener('resize',layout);$('pause')?.querySelector('.card')?.append(btn('Sự Kiện / Trực Tuyến',()=>open('ach')));
function open(id){focusBefore=document.activeElement;page=id;modal.hidden=false;const account=id==='account';modal.classList.toggle('pn-account-page',account);lobby.inert=account;head.inert=account;const headingIcon=pixelIcon(id);headingIcon.classList.add('pn-tab-icon');$('pn-heading').replaceChildren(headingIcon,el('span',MENU.find(x=>x[0]===id)?.[1]||'Sự Kiện','pn-tab-label'));render();$('pn-close').focus();if(id!=='ach')init().catch(e=>say('Không tải được Firebase; chưa thể vào game. '+err(e)))}
async function init(){if(sdk)return sdk;if(loading)return loading;loading=(async()=>{const [App,H,F]=await Promise.all(['app','auth','firestore'].map(n=>import('https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/10.14.1/firebase-'+n+'.js'))),app=App.getApps().find(a=>a.name==='pnt-online')||App.initializeApp(CONFIG,'pnt-online');sdk={H,F};auth=H.getAuth(app);db=F.getFirestore(app);H.onAuthStateChanged(auth,u=>onUser(u).catch(e=>say(err(e))));return sdk})().catch(e=>{loading=null;throw e});return loading}
async function onUser(u){for(const f of unsubs)f();unsubs=[];clearInterval(timer);testInventory(u?.uid);user=u;document.body.classList.toggle('pn-locked',!u);if(u&&page==='account')close();profilesReady=false;rankPublished=false;players=[];online=[];messages.clear();dayState=null;if(!u){open('account');say('');if(!modal.hidden)render();return}say('Đã đăng nhập · Firestore');const F=sdk.F;try{await loadEvents()}catch(e){say('Đồng bộ sự kiện: '+err(e))}const watch=(q,fn)=>unsubs.push(F.onSnapshot(q,fn,e=>say('Theo dõi '+q.type+': '+err(e))));watch(F.query(F.collection(db,'pnt_chat'),F.orderBy('t','desc'),F.limit(200)),snap=>{for(const d of snap.docs){const m=d.data();if(m.t){m.ms=m.t.toMillis();messages.set(m.uid+'_'+m.ms,m)}}messages=new Map([...messages.entries()].sort((a,b)=>b[1].ms-a[1].ms).slice(0,200));latestChat();if(page==='chat'&&!modal.hidden)chatLog()});watch(F.collection(db,'pnt_players'),snap=>{players=snap.docs.map(d=>({...d.data(),uid:d.id}));profilesReady=true;scheduleRankExpiry();awardRankTitle();latestChat();if(!modal.hidden&&['rank','chat','account','online'].includes(page))render()});watch(F.collection(db,'pnt_presence'),snap=>{online=snap.docs.map(d=>d.data());if(page==='online'&&!modal.hidden)render()});await heartbeat();timer=setInterval(()=>{heartbeat();awardRankTitle();latestChat();if(!modal.hidden&&['rank','chat','account'].includes(page))render()},45000);if(!modal.hidden)render()}
async function publishRank(){if(!user)return;sample();const base=realSave(),s=base.pnt||{},p={ai:Math.min(60,N(base.ai?.best))},metrics=rankMetrics(base);await sdk.F.setDoc(sdk.F.doc(db,'pnt_players',user.uid),{uid:user.uid,name:name(),realmIndex:Math.min(99,N(s.realm)),level:Math.min(100000,N(s.level)),money:Math.min(1e12,metrics.wallet),cleared:p.ai,titleId:s.claimed?.[s.title]?s.title:'',...metrics,updatedAt:sdk.F.serverTimestamp()},{merge:true});rankPublished=true;await awardRankTitle()}
async function heartbeat(){if(!user||!navigator.onLine||document.hidden)return;try{await sdk.F.setDoc(sdk.F.doc(db,'pnt_presence',user.uid),{uid:user.uid,name:name(),lastSeen:sdk.F.serverTimestamp()});if(Date.now()-lastRank>15000){await publishRank();lastRank=Date.now()}}catch(e){say(err(e))}}
async function loadEvents(){if(!user)return;const snap=await sdk.F.getDocs(sdk.F.collection(db,'pnt_events',user.uid,'days'));totalDays=0;dayState={day:DAY(),checkin:false,spinCount:0};snap.forEach(d=>{const x=d.data();if(x.checkin)totalDays++;if(x.day===DAY())dayState=x});S().events[user.uid]={day:DAY(),checkin:dayState.checkin,spinCount:dayState.spinCount,totalDays};persist()}
async function eventClaim(kind){if(!user){open('account');return}if(busy)return;busy=true;render();try{await loadEvents();const F=sdk.F,u=user.uid,day=DAY(),r=F.doc(db,'pnt_events',u,'days',String(day)),idx=totalDays%7;let prize=0,cost=0,prizeIndex=0;if(kind==='spin'){const n=crypto.getRandomValues(new Uint32Array(1))[0]/4294967296*100;let sum=0;prizeIndex=WHEEL.findIndex(p=>(sum+=p[1])>n);prize=WHEEL[Math.max(0,prizeIndex)][0];if(typeof prize==='string'&&gearSave().items.length>=80)throw Error('Kho đủ 80 trang bị; hãy dọn một ô trước khi quay.')}await F.runTransaction(db,async tx=>{const snap=await tx.get(r),s=snap.exists()?snap.data():{uid:u,day,checkin:false,spinCount:0};if(kind==='daily'){if(s.checkin)throw Error('Hôm nay đã điểm danh.');prize=DAILY[idx];s.checkin=true}else{if(s.spinCount>=3)throw Error('Đã hết 3 lượt hôm nay.');cost=s.spinCount<2?0:150;if(N(SAVE.lt)<cost)throw Error('Cần 150 linh thạch cho lượt thứ ba.');s.spinCount++}tx.set(r,{uid:u,day,checkin:s.checkin,spinCount:s.spinCount,updatedAt:F.serverTimestamp()})});questAdd(kind==='spin'?'spin':'checkin',1);if(typeof prize==='string')addGear(prize,0);SAVE.lt=N(SAVE.lt)+(typeof prize==='number'?prize:0)-cost;const prizeText=typeof prize==='number'?prize+' linh thạch':({thanhphong:'Thanh Phong Kiếm',vanvan:'Vân Văn Đạo Bào',phongthan:'Phong Thần Bội'})[prize]+' · Phàm cấp 1';persist();if(kind==='spin'&&$('pn-wheel')){$('pn-wheel').style.transform='rotate('+(1440+360-(prizeIndex*40+20))+'deg)';await new Promise(r=>setTimeout(r,1150))}toast('Nhận '+(typeof prize==='number'?'◈ ':'⚔ ')+prizeText+(cost?' · phí '+cost:''));S().lastWheel={prize,index:prizeIndex,day:DAY()};persist();await loadEvents();say('Đã nhận '+prizeText+'. Đổi ngày 07:00 Việt Nam (UTC).')}catch(e){say(err(e))}finally{busy=false;render()}}
function rewardLabel(text,gear=false){const e=el('span',undefined,'pn-reward');e.innerHTML=gear?'<svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="#6aafe0" d="M2 1h12v3h-2v6H4V4H2z"/><path fill="#bbcbd6" d="M6 1h4v12H6z"/><path fill="#f1c453" d="M2 11h12v2H2zM7 13h2v3H7z"/></svg>':'<svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="#78c69d" d="M4 1h8l4 7-8 7-8-7z"/><path fill="#c7f6e0" d="M4 1h5L6 8H0z"/><path fill="#389f9a" d="M6 8h10l-8 7z"/></svg>';if(!gear)e.replaceChildren(stoneIcon());e.append(document.createTextNode(text));return e}
